   "solution_html": "<p>(2 \u2212 <span class=\"math\">x</span>)<sup>6</sup> = 64 \u2212 192<span class=\"math\">x</span> + 240<span class=\"math\">x</span><sup>2</sup> \u2212 \u2026 (using <sup>6</sup>C<sub>1</sub>\u00b72<sup>5</sup> = 192 and <sup>6</sup>C<sub>2</sub>\u00b72<sup>4</sup> = 240). (1 + <span class=\"math\">x</span>)<sup>2</sup> = 1 + 2<span class=\"math\">x</span> + <span class=\"math\">x</span><sup>2</sup>.</p><p><span class=\"math\">x</span><sup>2</sup>: 240\u00b71 + (\u2212192)\u00b72 + 64\u00b71 = 240 \u2212 384 + 64 = <span class=\"key\">\u221280</span>.</p>",
