   "topic": "Circles: chord length",
   "spec_refs": [
    "MM3.2",
    "MM3.3"
   ],
   "difficulty": 3,
   "stem_html": "<p>A circle passes through the points (0, 0), (6, 0) and (0, 8).</p><p>What is the length of the chord of this circle that lies on the line <span class=\"math\">y</span> = <span class=\"math\">x</span>?</p>",
