   "stem_html": "<p>Given that <span class=\"int-wrap\"><span class=\"int\">\u222b</span><span class=\"lim\"><span>3</span><span>0</span></span>f(<span class=\"math\">x</span>) d<span class=\"math\">x</span></span> = 7 and <span class=\"int-wrap\"><span class=\"int\">\u222b</span><span class=\"lim\"><span>1</span><span>0</span></span>f(<span class=\"math\">x</span>) d<span class=\"math\">x</span></span> = 2, what is <span class=\"int-wrap\"><span class=\"int\">\u222b</span><span class=\"lim\"><span>3</span><span>1</span></span>(f(<span class=\"math\">x</span>) + 2<span class=\"math\">x</span>) d<span class=\"math\">x</span></span> ?</p>",
